        -:  950:
        -:  951:
        -:  952:/* Stock objects
        -:  953:
        -:  954:  wxStockGDI creates the stock GDI objects on demand.  Pointers to the
        -:  955:  created objects are stored in the ms_stockObject array, which is indexed
        -:  956:  by the Item enum values.  Platform-specific fonts can be created by
        -:  957:  implementing a derived class with an override for the GetFont function.
        -:  958:  wxStockGDI operates as a singleton, accessed through the ms_instance
